        "terrain": "No geographic terrain intended. Low red oval ornament with concentric brass rings remains present on closed lid; fine rings compress at mobile size. No temple or other landscape omission is inferred.",
        "texture": "Runtime preserves nested red diamonds on black panels but has warmer, streakier lid shading and weaker lacquer depth/reflections than the glossy marketing image. Busy procedural joins and crowded/jagged mobile lines remain visible. Marketing broad pale lid reflection is not reproduced in the browser lighting; images are not calibrated."
